Hello Jan and Alexandra,

Thank you very much for your patience, I am getting back to the request now. I have updated the EC “Driver Unlawfully Detained The Rider“ with the following queries to the reported user (matches with the EC “Rider Unlawfully Detained The Driver” now: 

{{* Inform the reported user about the suspension on their account, and that you are contacting them regarding a trip (provide them with the date);}}

{{* You can address the allegation, but it is essential to paraphrase it in a professional manner, refraining from using slang or sharing excessive details.}}

{{* While it's important to address the allegation, confidentiality must be maintained and specific information from the report cannot be shared.}}



Regarding the second point, I would recommend logging such cases as safety. Depending on the report, it might be necessary to report to the police as well, especially if the user shares intentions to harm someone. 

Hope this helps! 🙂 

All the best,

Galina

