* no clear description of data transfer (same as in the CZ case);
* supplier must comply with [https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/#:~:text=You%20must%20implement%20information%20security,privacy%20controls%20have%20been%20implemented.|https://bolt.eu/en/security/supplier-requirements/#:~:text=You%20must%20implement%20information%20security,privacy%20controls%20have%20been%20implemented.|smart-link] 

