{color:#97a0af}That’s why it is important for us to make resonably sure that Razvan Crisan has a right to sign the contract with us. I would say that we have enough good chance to argument that Rizwan Crisan has this right based on the association letter, if Andrei Gheorghe should come to us and accuse us of signing a invalid contract and making restaurant available contrary to his wishes. {color}{color:#97a0af}*But ofc, this is also risky and it may turn out that the interpretation was incorrect.*{color}

{color:#97a0af}*SUMMARY:*{color}
{color:#97a0af}*A. SAFEST approach is probably to keep restaurant suspended (i.e hidden) until dispute has been solved. But this may take even years in these type of disputes.*{color}
{color:#97a0af}*B. RISKIER but still argumentable option would be to make restaurant available if some of the conditions are fulfilled.*{color}

