 Ideally, privacy advises to send all drivers who registered a notice at the very least a few days in advance of posting (to give us some time for changes) clarifying that we are going to post a video from the event which may include them, and that if they do not want to be in the video, they can send the objection request to us, and we will remove them.
{panel}

It is the responsibility of the leadership team overseeing this project to not proceed with the advice, and post the videos without clearly informing the drivers that the recording was intended to be made public. This is in addition to the copyright risk flagged by the legal team.

